atched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F52E27D67C654AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111517014:0":{"text":"分かってないのは、あんたの方だろ。","source_cn":"我看一无所知的那个，是你吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44EC15A89803E380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111517015:0":{"text":"ほう……勇敢なる子よ。あなたのことは知っていますよ。","source_cn":"哦……有勇气的孩子。我知道你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D2EAD148A29BB7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111517016:0":{"text":"おかしな話ですが、デューラは残陽神が残した力を使って私を封印したのです。","source_cn":"说来可笑，艾雅将我封印时，借用了残阳神余留的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBC932E94E5E12F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111517017:0":{"text":"なので、私もあなたと同じ、時々残陽神の耳障りな声が聞こえるのですよ。","source_cn":"因此，我也和你一样，偶尔能听见残阳神那烦扰的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC0D72B4B0517CAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1111517018:0":{"text":"残陽神はずっとあなたが来ることを……あなた方が私を倒すと信じているようですね、ふふふふ……","source_cn":"残阳神一直相信你会来，相信你们能够将我打败。呵呵呵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B3087C369CB6EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","v